  "description": "Remove Duplicates from Sorted Array II (LeetCode 80) explained: a write pointer keeps a value unless it equals the kept value two slots back, nums[k-2]; one pass, O(n), O(1), generalises to at most m copies; code in Go, C++, Java, Python.",
